atlas optimization-compression-law

architecture compression-law
  canonical_name CompressionLaw
  owns SmallestSufficientState
  consumes ForeignWorld
  consumes Identity
  consumes Authority
  consumes FactDelta
  publishes SmallestSufficientState
  publishes RepresentationSelection
  family optimization
  domain Optimization / Governing law
  layer substrate
  semantic_question What is the smallest state that still supports every lawful operation over this subject, and does the current representation exceed it?
  purpose State the governing law of the machine: Bonfyre compiles high-entropy reality into the smallest sufficient executable state and then uses the cheapest adequate operator over that state. Every estate admitted to Bonfyre is a source world to be factored, addressed and packed, not a thing to ingest and reproduce.
  maturity architectural
  source_path cmd/BonfyreCompress/src/physical.c
  source_path schemas/control/representation-passport.cue
  witness cmd/BonfyreCompress/tests/physical_compiler_test.sh compiles arbitrary passport declarations into dense integer handles, rejects unknown semantic fields and conflicting byte declarations for one physical digest, materializes one deduplicated physical-body record for multiple separate passports, and refuses an unmeasured latent body from the candidate cut
  witness cmd/BonfyreCompress/results/physical-compiler/structural-100k.json records a 100,000-record synthetic structural registry compilation; this is a physical handle/index witness only, not a user, traffic, or Internet-scale claim
  witness cmd/BonfyreCompress/results/physical-compiler/structural-1m.json records a 1,000,000-record synthetic structural registry compilation; this is a physical handle/index witness only, not a user, traffic, or Internet-scale claim
  witness cmd/BonfyreCompress/results/physical-compiler/structural-10m-local.json records a 10,000,000-record synthetic structural registry compilation on the stated 16 GiB host (61.19 seconds, 403.99913 SQLite bytes/passport); it is a physical handle/index witness only, not a user, traffic, retrieval, BitNet, FPQ, or Internet-scale claim
  node_types SourceWorld
  node_types SharedBasis
  node_types TypedBinding
  node_types SparseException
  node_types RepresentationInstance
  edge_types factored_into
  edge_types bound_to
  edge_types excepted_by
  edge_types addressed_by
  invariant the target form is shared exact bases plus typed bindings plus sparse meaningful exceptions plus compact addresses
  invariant compression is not deletion; every factored form retains a path back to the original meaning
  invariant compression is not approximation of authority; permission, ownership and effect admission stay exact and lossless
  invariant compression is not genericization; a domain object keeps its identity when its mechanics are shared
  invariant an exception is preserved when it carries meaning and collapsed only when it is incidental repetition
  invariant every LOWER retains a LIFT or THAW path; an irreversible reduction is a deletion and requires a deletion proof
  invariant a body that must be fully expanded before any useful operation is only partly compressed
  invariant authoring and boundary forms are not runtime forms; parse once, then operate on dense state
  invariant an unchanged content-digested passport snapshot does not replace the dense registry again
  invariant physical-digest deduplication retains one derived body record while preserving every separate passport identity, semantic digest, basis/binding/exception and lift/thaw route
  invariant two declarations for one physical digest must agree on declared bytes; a conflict refuses the compiled generation rather than silently selecting an accounting value
  forbidden_inference two objects sharing a basis -> those objects being the same object
  forbidden_inference a domain's mechanics being shared -> the domains being merged
  forbidden_inference smaller representation -> better representation, absent a measured quality envelope
  forbidden_inference a correct result -> an admissible representation
  forbidden_inference lossless byte compression -> compressed semantics
  interacts optimization-cascade
  interacts optimization-proof
  interacts cheap-cognition
  source_lineage Generation-10 optimization doctrine promotion, 2026-08-26

calculation PhysicalCompiler
  input RepresentationPassport declarations
  input access phenotype subject family, operation, exactness demand, loss budget
  process preflight source declarations, atomically replace compiled handle rows, normalize shared bases, typed subject-family bindings and sparse exceptions into separate relations, partition support operations, and return only exact or measured-latent candidate bodies
  output RepresentationCandidateCut
  invariant the compiler returns eligible representations rather than a selected representation; ResourceAdmission and the exact owner remain downstream
  invariant exact operations exclude latent bodies even when they advertise the requested operation
  invariant a declared latent representation has no admissible preservation envelope and is excluded from the candidate cut
  invariant a shared basis, typed binding, and sparse exception stay physically distinct from the passport identity; factoring does not merge subjects
  invariant a physical digest is retained once in the derived body relation and may be referenced by many distinct passports; retained body equality is not subject equality
  forbidden_inference a compiled passport -> a physical measurement having been executed

calculation CompressionLedgerRuntime
  input executed CopyReceipt counters
  process preserve runtime bytes read, borrowed, copied, hydrated, decompressed, and useful bytes separately from declaration-time costs
  output CompressionLedgerReceipt
  invariant declared passport costs and executed runtime measurements are never aggregated into an unnamed percentage
  forbidden_inference a representation declaration containing bytes -> those bytes having been measured on this machine

calculation StructuralRegistryBenchmark
  input labelled synthetic record count
  process compile dense passport handles plus one operation index in an in-memory SQLite registry and measure elapsed time and allocated SQLite pages
  output StructuralRegistryMeasurement
  invariant a synthetic structural cohort is reported independently from actual estate populations and does not establish adoption, traffic, retrieval quality, or external-source capacity
  forbidden_inference a 100000-record structural compile -> a 100000-user or 100000-source production capacity claim

representation_tier authoring
  detail YaFF, CUE, JSON, foreign payloads, human-authored contracts. Verbose on purpose. Parsed once at admission.
  runtime_use forbidden

representation_tier exact-dense
  detail Interned strings, dictionary enums, packed structs, bitfields, bitmaps, sorted sparse sets, CSR adjacency, columnar relations, closure indexes, FactDelta streams.
  runtime_use hot
  losslessness required

representation_tier latent
  detail Embeddings, shared latent bases plus quantized residuals, sparse features, phenotype coordinates.
  runtime_use candidate reduction only
  losslessness not required
  invariant a latent representation narrows a candidate set; it never decides authority

representation_tier physical
  detail Arrow, mmap, SQLite and Turso, Feldera, Lance, DuckDB and Daft, Zstd frames, FPQ families, external handles.
  runtime_use selected per access pattern
  invariant one semantic subject may hold several bodies; no single physical format is mandated for all uses

representation_tier boundary
  detail Browser and API JSON, human YaFF, PDF, XLSX and other delivery formats.
  runtime_use egress only
  invariant a boundary form is produced at the boundary and never consumed back into the hot path

interaction law-governs-cascade
  source compression-law
  destination optimization-cascade
  relation governing_constraint
  preserves the distinction between exact lossless state and approximate latent state
  drops any claim that a cheaper representation is admissible without a measured quality envelope
  forbidden_inference a cascade stage being available -> that stage being appropriate for this subject
